  "synopsis": "Meil is a 33-year-old knight who serves as the captain of the princess' royal guard in the Kingdom of Chronowork. Despite her attractive appearance and prestigious position, she remains unmarried and has yet to find a partner. Burdened with exhausting duties in a kingdom plagued by resource shortages, Meil struggles to find time for romance while venting her frustrations to her deputy, Mena, and navigating her demanding daily life.\n\n(Source: MAL News)",
